Codes :
(a) 1 and 2
(b) 2 and 3
(c) 2 and 4
(d) 1 and 4
@ans (*)
@note When asked (1998), the **Mangalore Refinery (MRPL)** was a private joint venture and **Essar Oil** private, so (c) was correct. MRPL later became an **ONGC** subsidiary, leaving only Essar (Nayara) private; the source marks it (*).
@end
