@pyq U.P.P.C.S. (Mains) 2004
Which of the following oil refinery is in the private sector?
(a) Digboi Oil Refinery
(b) Barauni Oil Refinery
(c) Numaligarh Oil Refinery
(d) Mathura Oil Refinery
@ans (*)
@note All four are **public sector** refineries (Digboi, Barauni and Mathura belong to **IOCL**; Numaligarh to NRL), so there is no right option; the source marks it (*). India's largest private refinery is **Reliance's Jamnagar** complex, the world's largest single-site refinery.
@end
